y be shown in the app if there is already an association to the engagement.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"number\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"feedbacksubmissioninformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":true,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Pinned engagement ID\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":false},\"name\":\"hs_pinned_engagement_id\",\"options\":[],\"type\":\"number\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2024-08-12T15:56:46.877Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"The positive follow-up response of the feedback submission\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"text\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"feedbacksubmissioninformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":true,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Positive follow-up\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":false},\"name\":\"hs_positive_follow_up\",\"options\":[],\"type\":\"string\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-08-12T15:56:46.877Z\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-21T19:06:57.164Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"Single top-level topic in a portal's Topic taxonomy that represents the reason the ticket/conversation was first opened\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":true,\"fieldType\":\"calculation_rollup\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"feedbacksubmissioninformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":true,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Primary ticket topic\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":false,\"readOnlyValue\":false},\"name\":\"hs_primary_ticket_topic\",\"options\":[],\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-21T19:06:57.164Z\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2025-06-02T13:42:17.096Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"ID of the quote which is associated to feedback submission\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"calculation_rollup\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"feedbacksubmissioninformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Quote ID\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_quote_id\",\"options\":[],\"type\":\"number\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-09-01T08:11:14.609Z\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"Determines whether a record can be edited by a user.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"booleancheckbox\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"feedbacksubmissioninformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":true,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Read only object\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_read_only\",\"options\":[{\"displayOrder\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"True\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"displayOrder\":1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"False\",\"value\":\"false\"}],\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2019-08-06T02:44:02.327Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"The sentiment of the feedback submission\",\"displayOrder\":5,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"select\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"feedbacksubmissioninformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Feedback sentiment\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_response_group\",\"options\":[{\"description\":\"This is a detractor response\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"Detractor\",\"value\":\"DETRACTOR\"},{\"description\":\"This is a helpful response\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"Helpful\",\"value\":\"HELPFUL\"},{\"description\":\"This is a passive response\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"Passive\",\"value\":\"PASSIVE\"},{\"description\":\"This is a promoter response\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"Promoter\",\"value\":\"PROMOTER\"},{\"description\":\"This is an unhelpful response\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"Unhelpful\",\"value\":\"UNHELPFUL\"}],\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"updatedAt\":\"2022-10-13T08:32:20.589Z\"},{\"calculated\":true,\"calculationFormula\":\"(if (string(hs_survey_type) equals 'NPS' or (is_present(string(hs_industry_standard_question_type)) and is_present(hs_value) and string(hs_industry_standard_question_type) equals 'NPS')) then (if (hs_value >= 0 and hs_value <= 6) then 'Detractor'\\nelse(if (hs_value >= 7 and hs_value <= 8) then 'Passive' else 'Promoter'))\\nelse(if (string(hs_survey_type) equals 'CES' or (is_present(string(hs_industry_standard_question_type)) and is_present(hs_value) and string(hs_industry_standard_question_type) equals 'CES')) then (if (hs_value >= 1 and hs_value <= 3) then 'Difficult'\\nelse(if (hs_value >= 4 and hs_value <= 5) then 'Neutral' else 'Easy'))\\nelse(if (string(hs_survey_type) equals 'CSAT' or (is_present(string(hs_industry_standard_question_type)) and is_present(hs_value) and string(hs_industry_standard_question_type) equals 'CSAT')) then (if hs_value equals 0 then 'Unhappy'\\nelse(if hs_value equals 1 then 'Neutral' else 'Happy'))\\nelse(if string(hs_survey_type) equals 'KNOWLEDGE' then (if hs_value equals 0 then 'Unhelpful' else 'Helpful') else 'Not Applicable'))))\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-01-10T19:02:05.329Z\",\"createdUserId\":\"0\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"Sentiment of feedback submission based on survey type\",\"displayOrder\":0,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"select\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"feedbacksubmissioninformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Sentiment\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_sentiment\",\"options\":[{\"description\":\"Detractor sentiment - relevant to NPS survey\",\"displayOrder\":0,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Detractor\",\"value\":\"Detractor\"},{\"description\":\"Difficult sentiment - relevant to CES survey\",\"displayOrder\":1,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Difficult\",\"value\":\"Difficult\"},{\"description\":\"Easy sentiment - relevant to CES survey\",\"displayOrder\":2,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Easy\",\"value\":\"Easy\"},{\"description\":\"Happy sentiment - relevant to CSAT survey\",\"displayOrder\":3,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Happy\",\"value\":\"Happy\"},{\"description\":\"Helpful sentiment - relevant to knowledge survey\",\"displayOrder\":4,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Helpful\",\"value\":\"Helpful\"},{\"description\":\"Neutral sentiment - relevant to CES and CSAT surveys\",\"displayOrder\":5,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Neutral\",\"value\":\"Neutral\"},{\"description\":\"Sentiment is not applicable for the feedback submission.\",\"displayOrder\":6,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Not Applicable\",\"value\":\"Not Applicable\"},{\"description\":\"Passive sentiment - relevant to NPS survey\",\"displayOrder\":7,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Passive\",\"value\":\"Passive\"},{\"description\":\"Promoter sentiment - relevant to NPS survey\",\"displayOrder\":8,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Promoter\",\"value\":\"Promoter\"},{\"description\":\"Unhappy sentiment - relevant to CSAT survey\",\"displayOrder\":9,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Unhappy\",\"value\":\"Unhappy\"},{\"description\":\"Unhelpful sentiment - relevant to knowledge survey\",\"displayOrder\":10,\"hidden\":true,\"label\":\"Unhelpful\",\"value\":\"Unhelpful\"}],\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-11-06T20:33:29.932Z\",\"updatedUserId\":\"0\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"Additional teams whose users can access the record based on their permissions. This ca